Package: BMABOINET
Type: Package
Title: Endpoint-Specific Bayesian Partition Averaging for Basket Dose Optimization
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("BMA-BOIN-ET", "Development Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "haohaostats@users.noreply.github.com")
Author: haohaostats [aut, cre]
Maintainer: haohaostats <haohaostats@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Prospective design, interim analysis, borrowing diagnostics, and
    final dose selection for Bayesian optimal interval basket trials with
    toxicity and efficacy endpoints. Endpoint- and dose-specific sharing
    structures are averaged exactly over basket partitions, with local safety
    protection and audit-ready decision outputs.
